cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this software, data, or the associated mathematical results,
  please cite this research compendium and the preferred paper below.
title: "RGΦ: Exact rational radix–Möbius dynamics research compendium"
type: software
abstract: >-
  Exact mathematical and computational research compendium for a noncommutative
  rational semigroup generated by an integer-radix transformation and a
  Möbius-conjugate branch. The release candidate includes exact extremal-target
  results, threshold-robustness data, finite modular-trap evidence, verification
  software, and the associated manuscript.
